abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted Lean 4 companion to Models for dagger (infinity,1)-categories II.
  The original universe-zero four-link Theorem C is proved locally with the
  original models, adjoints, ordered endpoints and hypotheses. Completeness of
  the original input is not added. The final theorem and four literal targets
  have standard transitive axioms only. Saved evidence covers 359 used named
  stages, 1182 printed standard axiom reports and an original project-source
  freshness gate. Part I is a separate pinned Git dependency. The English PDF
  catalogue identifies its prose as AI-generated. A cold full build of this
  separate repository, new Linux CI or Comparator pass, and independent human
  correspondence review are not claimed.
